<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Jan 27.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Jan 27.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JOURNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- The United Nations Development Programme plans to give nearly $4 million for the rehabilitation of infrastructure in Ukuma, in Huambo province.</p>
<p>- Ernesto Chicucuma, director of the Angolan Association of Grain Producers and Agents, said during an interview that Angola must become self-sufficient in food production.</p>
